OL,3,AGTA 6 sales hit $3.8bn in a single day
OL,4,A- the biggest entertainment launch in
OL,5,Ahistory
OL,6,
OL,7,FGrand Theft Auto 6 (GTA 6) saw record
OL,8,Fretail sales in its first full-day of
OL,9,Frelease, hitting $3.8bn (#2.9bn),
OL,10,Fmaking it the biggest entertainment
OL,11,Flaunch in history.
OL,13,FTake-Two, the parent company of
OL,14,FRockstar Games, said on Friday the
OL,15,Ffigures were based on estimates through
OL,16,Fend of day on Thursday and marked a
OL,17,Frecord for "entertainment across any
OL,18,Fmedium". It pre-sold 32.5m copies of
OL,19,Fthe game.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/18
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
