OL,3,AWhy Nicola Coughlan's new drama might
OL,4,Aleave viewers uncomfortable
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis article contains spoilers for I Am
OL,7,FHelen
OL,9,FIf you want to unwind on the sofa after
OL,10,Fa long day, I Am Helen probably isn't
OL,11,Fthe show for you.
OL,13,FThe Channel 4 drama starring Bridgerton
OL,14,Fstar Nicola Coughlan and Joe Cole from
OL,15,FPeaky Blinders has been called a
OL,16,Fmust-watch by critics - but the cast
OL,17,Fdon't want viewers sitting comfortably.
OL,19,F"There's going to be a few awkward
OL,20,Fsofas," Cole, who plays Helen's partner
OL,21,FSteve, says.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/18
