OL,14,     Ffor a highland winter and caring
OL,15,     Ffor meconopses.
OL,16,G1445 Opening Lines
OL,17,     FIn the first of two episodes, John
OL,18,     FYorke examines Victor Hugo's
OL,19,     Fmagnificent Les Miserables.
OL,20,     FWritten with anger and compassion,
OL,21,     Fit is one of the great novels of
OL,22,     Fthe 19th century.
